[MedRec]

New novel records
+
Old historical records
+
new completed POMR if applicable
→ episode/date descending

[consultation]

New novel / replacement records
+
Old records

[surgical operation]

New novel / replacement records
+
Old records

[radiotherapy]

New novel / replacement records
